    "repairRules": [
      {
        "id": "startup_path",
        "ruleId": "mfa.launch_owner",
        "resourceId": "config:instances/{instance}.json",
        "selector": [
          "SoftwarePath"
        ],
        "source": "user_snapshot",
        "format": "json",
        "kind": "bind_game_path",
        "fromValues": [],
        "toValue": "",
        "preconditions": {
          "snapshotKind": "any",
          "exclusiveResource": true,
          "noExtraConfig": false
        },
        "explanation": "将当前实例启动设置中的软件路径设为项目游戏路径；共享配置只生成当前实例覆盖，应用前备份当前用户快照。"
      },
      {
        "id": "startup_action",
        "ruleId": "mfa.launch_owner",
        "resourceId": "config:instances/{instance}.json",
        "selector": [
          "BeforeTask"
        ],
        "source": "user_snapshot",
        "format": "json",
        "kind": "normalize_enum",
        "fromValues": [
          "StartupSoftwareAndScript"
        ],
        "toValue": "StartupSoftwareAndScript",
        "preconditions": {
          "snapshotKind": "any",
          "exclusiveResource": true,
          "noExtraConfig": false
        },
        "explanation": "将当前实例启动后操作设置为启动软件并运行脚本；配置编辑时由原生一次性禁止自动启动开关屏蔽该操作，其他账号及共享配置不变。"
      },
      {
        "id": "native_tasks",
        "ruleId": "mfa.finish_action",
        "resourceId": "config:instances/{instance}.json",
        "selector": [
          "TaskItems"
        ],
        "source": "user_snapshot",
        "format": "json",
        "kind": "mfa_tasks",
        "fromValues": [],
        "toValue": "",
        "preconditions": {
          "snapshotKind": "any",
          "exclusiveResource": true,
          "noExtraConfig": false
        },
        "explanation": "关闭当前实例的系统动作任务，保留日常与自定义程序的顺序、参数、进度和额度；应用前备份当前用户快照。"
      },
      {
        "id": "finish_action",
        "ruleId": "mfa.finish_action",
        "resourceId": "config:instances/{instance}.json",
        "selector": [
          "AfterTask"
        ],
        "source": "user_snapshot",
        "format": "json",
        "kind": "normalize_enum",
        "fromValues": [
          "None",
          "CloseMFA",
          "CloseEmulator",
          "CloseEmulatorAndMFA"
        ],
        "toValue": "None",
        "preconditions": {
          "snapshotKind": "any",
          "exclusiveResource": true,
          "noExtraConfig": false
        },
        "explanation": "仅修改当前用户快照的这一项；应用前备份原字节，其他账号及脚本现场保持不变。若还有修复项，请继续预览。"
      }
    ]
